# Agent directory: version only configuration, never runtime state.
# Secrets live in agent.db (auth_credentials) and sessions/, which stay ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!config.yml
!mcp.json
# Authored skills, extensions and the Skillshare lockfile (created on demand).
!skills/
!skills/**
!extensions/
!extensions/**
!skills.lock.json
